+    // MoE checkpoints, one step at a time.
+    //
+    // Separate from write() on purpose: write() asserts on the SSM chain
+    // (conv_output_raw-0, state_predelta-0, ...) and throws when a name is
+    // missing, which is the wrong failure for a tower whose interest is the
